  "scope_notes": [
    "Top10 ordered per window-digest row, not aggregated across windows; AVG_PROCESSED_KEYS/AVG_TOTAL_KEYS are key counts, not AVG_RESULT_ROWS.",
    "Initial long_transactions NOW()-START_TIME ages are NOT validated due to table/session timestamp mismatch; do not classify returned row as 8-hour transaction. Follow-up transaction_clock_check returns raw unfiltered rows up to 100.",
